1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
AI can give you a polished answer
in seconds.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
But did you learn it,
or did the AI do the thinking?

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Sparring changes that contract.
I upload my own PDF.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
The AI turns only that material
into three concepts and one target.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,500
Before any explanation,
I make a quick prediction.

6
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:39,000
It gives me something real to compare
with a source-grounded explanation.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:47,000
I answer before feedback
and commit my confidence.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Here I was very sure - and wrong.

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Sparring explains both the error
and the supported relationship.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,500
Next, I teach the idea back
in two lines.

11
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:17,000
My first version only lists the parts.

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,000
I revise one connection.
The explanation stays mine.

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Later, the same objective returns
in new wording, with no hints.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,000
A pass schedules day three,
then day seven.

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Practice evidence -
not permanent mastery.

16
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,500
FastAPI keeps the model key
on the server.

17
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:53,000
Structured outputs and source checks
stay inside my material.

18
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Sparring.
The AI study coach that keeps me thinking.
